#, fuzzy
msgid "Delete device"
msgstr "أجهزتي"

#: app/templates/device.html:40
msgid "Removes the device and its telemetry. This cannot be undone."
msgstr "يحذف الجهاز وقياساته. لا يمكن التراجع عن ذلك."

